Q. Idoc types ?
1. Master Data IDocs:
CREMAS/CREMAS02: Vendor master data.
DEBMAS/DEBMAS03: Customer master data.
MATMAS/MATMAS03: Material master data.
GLMAST/GLMAST01: General ledger account.
COSMAS/COSMAS01: Cost center.
COEMAS/COEMAS01: Cost element.
PRCMAS/PRCMAS01: Profit center.

2. Logistics IDocs:
ORDERS/ORDERS05: Purchase order.
INVOIC: Invoice.
DELFOR: Delivery forecast.
DESADV: Shipping notification.
INFREC/INFREC01: Purchasing info record.
ARTMAS/ARTMAS02: Article master.
PRDCAT/PRDCAT01: Product catalog.

